  "title": "Cognitive Atlas",
  "description": {
    "en": "The Cognitive Atlas is a collaborative knowledge building project that aims to develop an ontology that characterizes the state of current thought in cognitive science.  It defines a set of mental concepts along with a set of mental tasks, and the measurement relations between those classes."
